ode3.irmos2:
My heart hath been established in the Lord;
my horn hath been exalted in my God;
my mouth hath been enlarged over the enemy;//
and I am gladdened in Thy salvation.

ode6.irmos:
Cleanse me, O Savior,
for many are mine iniquities;
lead me up from the abyss of evils I pray Thee,
for unto Thee have I cried,
and Thou hast hearkened unto me,//
O God of my salvation.
